Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.13,0:00:08.33,Main - Italics,Hori,0,0,0,,So much has happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.24,0:00:23.47,Main - Italics,Hori,0,0,0,,Every day was new and different.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.25,0:00:25.00,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\b1\shad0\bord0\c&H618FAA&\frz10.55\frx10\fry10\move(269.091,141.272,341.818,141.272)}The Journey Begins
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.01,0:00:26.76,Main - Italics,Hori,0,0,0,,I won't pretend I remember all of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.25,0:00:30.24,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnTimes New Roman\fs20\shad0\bord3\c&H3F4E6C&\3c&HCED4DA&\b1\move(330.182,82.364,330.182,106.364)\t(\fs18)}Katagiri High School 63rd Graduation Ceremony
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.55,0:00:33.07,Main - Italics,Hori,0,0,0,,Most of the memories have\N faded and vanished,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.36,0:00:32.49,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1630,1)\an8\fnTimes New Roman\fs18\shad0\bord3\c&H3F4E6C&\3c&HCED4DA&\b1\t(\fs16)\move(324.727,112.182,324.727,131.819)}Katagiri High School 63rd Graduation Ceremony
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.57,0:00:34.74,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1630,1)\an8\fnTimes New Roman\fs14\shad0\bord3\c&H3F4E6C&\3c&HCED4DA&\b1\t(\fs12)\move(322.182,134.637,322.182,144.183)}Katagiri High School 63rd Graduation Ceremony
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.93,0:00:36.76,Main - Italics,Hori,0,0,0,,but many are just as vivid \Nas the day they happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.86,0:00:36.74,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1630,1)\an8\fnTimes New Roman\fs12\shad0\bord2\c&H3F4E6C&\3c&HCED4DA&\b1\t(\fs10)\move(322.182,144.092,322.182,150.001)}Katagiri High School 63rd Graduation Ceremony
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.76,0:00:42.94,Main - Italics,Hori,0,0,0,,I'm sure they're...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.60,0:02:18.75,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Kyoto!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.75,0:02:19.74,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Fall leaves!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.74,0:02:21.90,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Temples!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.90,0:02:23.21,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.21,0:02:25.49,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Yuki sure is excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.50,0:02:29.77,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Look at all the trees—
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.77,0:02:31.63,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Yoshikawa, cool your jets.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.63,0:02:33.12,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Toru, don't boss me around!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.12,0:02:33.71,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.71,0:02:34.88,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,Like a parent and child...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.88,0:02:38.20,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,It's Yuki's first time in Kyoto, \Nso she's raring to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.20,0:02:40.63,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,I got to come here in middle school.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.36,0:02:42.89,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,It's always Kyoto, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.89,0:02:44.65,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,My school trip was here, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.65,0:02:48.88,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,But now that we're high schoolers, we get to \Nexplore more on our own, which is great.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.88,0:02:50.39,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.81,0:02:52.65,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,Except at night...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.90,0:02:54.93,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,That's right, Miyamura...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.93,0:02:56.40,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,How are you going to bathe?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.97,0:02:59.98,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,I don't think I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.98,0:03:03.11,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,I'm prepared to go without \Nfor the whole trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.11,0:03:05.22,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,The girls have baths in their rooms,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.22,0:03:07.34,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,but the guys have to use the public one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.34,0:03:08.89,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Also, what about changing clothes?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.22,0:03:10.79,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,I'll change in the bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.28,0:03:12.70,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.70,0:03:13.89,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.54,0:03:17.81,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,{\i1}Am I even going to enjoy this trip?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.81,0:03:20.42,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is he even going to enjoy this trip?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.42,0:03:21.99,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,There you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.99,0:03:23.84,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,Took you guys long enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.84,0:03:24.92,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Hey, Shu.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.92,0:03:25.99,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.99,0:03:27.37,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,No one else is here, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.37,0:03:28.30,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Not a soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.30,0:03:30.01,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,I bet your yelling scared them off.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.01,0:03:31.41,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,What was that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.41,0:03:32.45,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,Check this out!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.45,0:03:34.96,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,Souvenirs from the shop up ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.56,0:03:37.57,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,They looked too good to pass up!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.57,0:03:39.24,Main - Italics,_Both,0,0,0,,He bought souvenirs on the first day?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.24,0:03:43.92,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Shu, what are you doing loading up when \Nwe haven't even been to the hotel yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.95,0:03:46.12,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,That's a good point!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.12,0:03:47.15,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,Wanna eat 'em, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.15,0:03:48.73,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,Want some, Miyamura?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.73,0:03:50.60,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,Huh? Um, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.60,0:03:53.31,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,I can't believe he bought \Nsouvenirs on the first day.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.31,0:03:55.71,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,{\i1}Where'd all her excitement go?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.71,0:03:59.12,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Oh, are you and Iura-kun in the same room?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.71,0:04:01.47,Main,SFX,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\shad0\fax-.3\bord0\c&H326BAF&\b1\frz7.42\move(277.091,130.364,413.091,124.546)}Laugh      Laugh
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.12,0:04:02.39,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,Yeah, but Ishikawa-kun's with us, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.17,0:04:02.51,Main,SFX,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,190)\fnComic Sans MS\shad0\bord1\c&HACB190&\fs30\b1\frz7.42\3c&H4F5B3F&\move(419.636,72.909,428.181,72.909)}Flash
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.12,0:04:05.82,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,I hope things work out...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.82,0:04:07.72,Main - Italics,Hori,0,0,0,,I have a feeling they won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.14,0:04:16.48,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1270,940)\fnArial\an8\b1\bord0\fs16\shad1\pos(518.545,111.091)\c&HE4E9B8&\3c&H514946&\4c&H514946&}Class Trip
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.48,0:04:19.10,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,The bed's so soft!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.10,0:04:22.24,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,This room is even better than I expected!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.24,0:04:25.92,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,They said we're free until dinner,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.92,0:04:27.75,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,but there's nothing to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.75,0:04:29.16,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.16,0:04:30.47,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Want to hit up another room?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.47,0:04:32.49,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Oh, like the boys' rooms?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.49,0:04:34.02,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,There you go again!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.50,0:04:39.24,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,Who picked up the key?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.24,0:04:40.52,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Shu. Shu has it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.52,0:04:41.73,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Where the hell is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.21,0:04:43.67,Main,_Mizouchi,0,0,0,,What are you guys doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.76,0:04:47.34,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Hey, Mizouchi, do you know where Shu is?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.34,0:04:48.81,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,He's got our room key.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.81,0:04:49.76,Main,_Mizouchi,0,0,0,,Iura?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.76,0:04:52.29,Main,_Mizouchi,0,0,0,,I saw him walk into the room a minute ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.89,0:04:54.86,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Shu, you jerk! Open the door!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.86,0:04:57.15,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,Ishikawa-kun, calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.66,0:05:02.15,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,C'mon, like I said... I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.18,0:05:06.08,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,At least let us in the room \Nbefore you take a nap, dumbass!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.01,0:05:09.08,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,Anyway, now that our stuff's in the room,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.08,0:05:10.91,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,we can relax until dinnertime.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.30,0:05:13.62,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Yeah, guess you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.62,0:05:15.73,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,How long do we have?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.73,0:05:17.88,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,Hang on. I'll check—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.42,0:05:20.67,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\u1\fnArial\fs12\b1\shad0\c&H383C3D&\3c&HD1D6D5&}Day 1{\u0}\N18:00-\h\h\h\h\hPublic bath (Boys only)\N\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h18:00- Class 1, Groups 1-4\N\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h18:30- Class 1, Group 5 & Class 2, Groups 1-2\N\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h30-minute bath time\N\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hClass 2, Groups 3 and up will bathe at 20:00 after dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.88,0:05:19.90,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Shu, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.90,0:05:20.92,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,Sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.67,0:05:23.17,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnImpact\shad0\pos(312.727,48.909)\c&H2D2E3A&\3c&HEEF4F1&}Class 1, Group 1
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.92,0:05:23.12,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll take a nap, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.12,0:05:26.68,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,Wait, don't we need to bathe before dinner?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.17,0:05:26.68,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnArial\b1\shad0\bord3\c&H33383F&\3c&HD1D6D5&}Public bath (Boys only)\N18:00- Class 1, Groups 1-4
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.68,0:05:27.92,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Do we?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.92,0:05:29.04,Main - Italics,Miya,0,0,0,,Oh crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.04,0:05:30.73,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,Miyamura, bath time!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.18,0:05:32.18,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\b1\shad0\bord0\pos(568.727,179.091)\c&HEAECE7&}Men
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.18,0:05:32.18,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\fs36\b1\shad0\bord0\c&HEAECE7&\pos(311.999,110.728)}Bath
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.73,0:05:32.18,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,N-No!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.18,0:05:35.52,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,What are you talking about? Let's go already!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.52,0:05:36.73,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,I... I, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.73,0:05:38.34,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,I'll bathe later.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.34,0:05:40.44,Main,Male Student A,0,0,0,,Hey, hurry it up, group 1!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.79,0:05:42.19,Main,Male Student A,0,0,0,,We're all waiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.19,0:05:44.79,Main - Italics,Miya,0,0,0,,H-Help me, Ishikawa-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.88,0:05:53.41,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Miyamura, you're not feeling well, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.41,0:05:55.81,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,You're not feeling well? Do you have a fever?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.81,0:05:56.59,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,Is it a cold?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.59,0:05:59.04,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,N-No, i-it's not a cold...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.04,0:06:02.80,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1190,690)\pos(127.273,78)\fnArial\fs14\shad0\bord1\c&HECDBC4&\b1\3c&H51332C&}Going for broke
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.41,0:06:02.78,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Shu, Miyamura's on his period.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.54,0:06:06.48,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.48,0:06:09.80,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,I-I-Is that right...?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.80,0:06:12.81,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1190,1)\pos(127.273,78)\fnArial\fs14\shad0\bord1\c&HECDBC4&\b1\3c&H51332C&}Going for broke
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.58,0:06:12.81,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.12,0:06:15.03,Main,Male Student A,0,0,0,,Hey, what's taking so long?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.03,0:06:16.27,Main,Male Student A,0,0,0,,Get in the bath already!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.27,0:06:17.06,Main,Male Student B,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.06,0:06:19.84,Main,Male Student B,0,0,0,,We're having an existential crisis here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.84,0:06:21.08,Main,Male Student A,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.08,0:06:23.99,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Miyamura, I did good, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.99,0:06:25.11,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,Yeah, good job.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.11,0:06:26.86,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,And goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.86,0:06:31.57,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.20,0:06:33.56,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Hey, Miyamura.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.23,0:06:35.45,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,Hori-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.45,0:06:37.24,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,I'm apparently on my period.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.24,0:06:40.08,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Says the guy who got\Na perfect score in phys ed?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.43,0:06:46.17,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Wait, is that your excuse to get\Nout of a bath? That's hilarious!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.04,0:06:48.70,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,So how are you gonna bathe today?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.14,0:06:52.18,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,My period's giving me cramps,\Nso I'll go without.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.18,0:06:54.60,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Want to use the shower in our room?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.26,0:06:58.35,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Yuki went to visit a friend\Nand won't be back for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.27,0:07:03.49,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,Won't we get in trouble for a guy \Ngoing into a girl's room?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.49,0:07:06.99,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Er, you don't have to if you don't want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.71,0:07:13.22,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,I'm alive again...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.22,0:07:15.63,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,C'mon, you coulda used the hair dryer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.63,0:07:19.21,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,Well, I'm sure I could have, \Nbut I didn't want to take too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.18,0:07:23.68,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,Any word from Yoshikawa-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.68,0:07:24.74,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.74,0:07:25.58,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.88,0:07:29.92,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,I should get my stuff ready for tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.51,0:07:31.71,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,Hori-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.71,0:07:35.89,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,Would you let just any guy into your \Nroom if they were in a tight spot?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.14,0:07:40.39,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,You really shouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.39,0:07:42.14,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Of course I wouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.81,0:07:43.68,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.68,0:07:44.82,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.90,0:07:47.62,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,But you let me in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.62,0:07:48.90,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Well, you're...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.90,0:07:50.50,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Not like that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.50,0:07:53.10,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,You're... fine, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.10,0:07:54.03,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Since you're...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.03,0:07:55.05,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,I'm what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.00,0:08:00.16,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,I'm what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.16,0:08:06.17,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Y-You wouldn't t-try anything, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.06,0:08:08.17,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.13,0:08:13.68,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,Well, I'll head on back to my room.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.68,0:08:15.42,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,Thanks for letting me use your shower.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.20,0:08:17.80,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Hey, wait—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.91,0:08:23.06,Main - Italics,Hori,0,0,0,,Even if I said he {\i0}could{\i1} try something,\N he wouldn't, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.90,0:08:29.81,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,{\i1}What was that about letting \Nother guys into my room?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.08,0:08:32.82,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,I took her towel with me...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.82,0:08:34.82,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Oh, Miyamura.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.82,0:08:37.07,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,Hey, Miyamura, gonna put on a yukata?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.07,0:08:38.45,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Did you go somewhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.80,0:08:42.14,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah. Sorta.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.72,0:08:48.11,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,Whoa, look! There are maiko here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.11,0:08:49.34,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Don't point!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.96,0:08:52.33,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Whoa! Hey there, ladies!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.33,0:08:53.72,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Don't wave at them!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.72,0:08:57.00,Main - Top,Yuki,0,0,0,,You two have no idea \Nhow to behave in public!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.17,0:08:57.00,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,I'll return your towel later.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.00,0:08:59.04,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,It's fine. We have plenty.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.04,0:09:01.72,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,More importantly, what about tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.98,0:09:04.62,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,The bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.62,0:09:06.63,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,If you're coming over, I'll handle Yuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.94,0:09:08.98,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,Oh, don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.20,0:09:13.34,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,I can always take the late bath\Nfor people who miss theirs.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.48,0:09:15.49,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnArial\b1\shad0\bord2\blur4\c&H33383F&\3c&HD1D6D5&\fs18\frz11.17\t(\fs19)\move(364.364,186.728,317.819,109.636,0,2991)}Anyone who misses their designated bath time can bathe after 23:00.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.34,0:09:15.49,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Oh, I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.00,0:09:18.49,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,I should have read it more carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.49,0:09:19.24,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.73,0:09:21.67,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Don't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.55,0:09:25.96,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Thanks for waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.96,0:09:27.50,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,It's all yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.93,0:09:28.88,Flashback - Italics,Miya,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.93,0:09:34.03,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Now I feel stupid for thinking \Nso much about how to respond.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.03,0:09:35.94,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,And why the hell didn't you read the rules?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.33,0:09:37.55,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Hori?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.55,0:09:39.46,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Are you gonna use the bath?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.46,0:09:42.15,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,I am! And I'm gonna be in there until 11:00!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.75,0:09:44.39,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,You'll be totally wrinkled.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.57,0:09:49.90,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,This class trip really flew by.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.20,0:09:51.76,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,It sure did.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.76,0:09:54.46,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,It won't be easy, but it's time \Nto say goodbye to Kyoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.46,0:09:56.54,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,At least we took lots of pics.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.54,0:09:58.16,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Oh, I've still got space for more!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.16,0:09:59.53,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Hori, gimme a peace sign!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.53,0:10:00.78,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Hey, cut it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.28,0:10:03.79,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,I'll print some pictures \Nand give you a copy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.28,0:10:05.58,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.58,0:10:08.71,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Counting the ones our teacher \Ntook, we'll have a ton.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.41,0:10:14.71,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Here's one of Iura messing with Toru.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.71,0:10:16.81,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,That was really funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.81,0:10:18.59,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Here's you stuffing your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.91,0:10:27.35,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,I hope we can all come \Nback together sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.35,0:10:28.35,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.02,0:10:30.10,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,1)\fnComic Sans MS\shad0\fs20\c&H314C52&\3c&HDFF3F4&\b1\frz341.4\pos(237.091,42.364)}Hee Hee
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.45,0:10:33.31,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,Hey! It's time to meet up at the buses!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.31,0:10:34.80,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.80,0:10:37.25,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,Man, I can't believe \Nwe're going home already.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.25,0:10:38.61,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,I'll race you to the bus!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.61,0:10:40.43,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,You're on!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.43,0:10:41.37,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Miyamura.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.26,0:10:46.87,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,This was a pretty good class trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.25,0:10:52.65,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,Yeah, it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.88,0:10:56.29,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Hurry up, you two!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.29,0:10:57.65,Main,_Both,0,0,0,,Yeah, coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.44,0:11:05.39,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,Miyamura-kun...?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.22,0:11:09.94,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,Wow, it is you! You cut your hair!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.94,0:11:12.10,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,W-Wait! Turn off the hose first!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.22,0:11:14.32,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,Oh, right!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.32,0:11:15.50,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.50,0:11:17.36,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,You really got soaked.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.90,0:11:20.36,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,It's okay. I'll wring out my clothes later.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.36,0:11:23.03,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,That won't do!\NYou need to dry off with a towel.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.03,0:11:24.47,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,Let's go to the clinic.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.56,0:11:26.99,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,The clinic?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.37,0:11:28.62,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\shad0\c&H39343A&\3c&HCDC8CB&\b1\pos(315.637,123.818)}Clinic
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.05,0:11:29.80,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.12,0:11:31.99,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,Ah, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.75,0:11:35.85,Main - Italics,Miya,0,0,0,,No one's here. Are we allowed \Nto just use the towels?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.50,0:11:38.66,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,Why not take off your cardigan?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.60,0:11:43.13,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,I'll just leave it on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.89,0:11:49.20,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,I've been wondering...\NWhy do you always stay all covered up?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.20,0:11:52.83,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,You didn't even bathe with \Nthe other guys during the class trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.83,0:11:58.27,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,All of the boys pick swimming for phys ed,\N but you always pick running.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.27,0:12:01.65,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,Th-The council president runs \Nduring swimming time, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.65,0:12:03.59,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,Oh, I don't mind Sengoku-kun doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.59,0:12:04.41,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,Why not?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.78,0:12:07.35,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,Actually, Sengoku-kun told me \Nyou always change clothes
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.35,0:12:10.29,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,in the bathroom or an empty classroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.29,0:12:11.79,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,230)\fs20\fnComic Sans MS\shad0\bord0\b1\frz11.82\pos(257.455,37.273)\c&H915CC3&}Wants to know
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.29,0:12:11.98,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,So, why is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.98,0:12:14.79,Main - Italics,Miya,0,0,0,,Crap. She's more persistent than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.42,0:12:19.55,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.41,0:12:22.70,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,I thought you might actually \Nbe a girl or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.23,0:12:26.30,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,Do I {\i1}look{\i0} like a girl to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.77,0:12:29.71,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Ah, so she's suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.71,0:12:32.41,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,I feel like she's gonna find me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.41,0:12:33.84,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,I'm exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.84,0:12:35.38,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,And hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.38,0:12:36.88,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,{\i1}So you {\i0}do{\i1} get hot in that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.20,0:12:39.57,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Y'know, I had a thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.57,0:12:43.57,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,600)\fs18\fnComic Sans MS\b1\shad0\bord0\frz2.332\c&H5A5449&\move(492.363,318,193.454,318.728,1810,3400)}Something like a vest
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.96,0:12:41.27,Main - Top,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Why not wear something like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.27,0:12:42.95,Main - Top,Miya,0,0,0,,My arms would show.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.95,0:12:44.07,Main - Top,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Ah...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.44,0:12:46.64,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Yet you'll wear a sailor-style uniform.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.07,0:12:47.32,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\frz17.13\fnArial\fs14\shad0\bord2\c&H000000&\b1\pos(338.909,191.455)\3c&HF7FAF8&}This is my old middle school uniform.\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\N\NTry it on when you have the chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.32,0:12:49.83,Flashback - Italics,Miya,0,0,0,,I don't want to try it on \Neven when I have the chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.70,0:12:53.15,Flashback - Italics,Miya,0,0,0,,I don't know why Hori-san wants me to.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.33,0:12:58.19,Flashback - Italics,Miya,0,0,0,,I'll just put it on and \Ntell her it was too small.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.19,0:12:59.59,Flashback - Italics,Miya,0,0,0,,There's no way it'll fit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.10,0:13:04.84,Flashback - Top,Iori,0,0,0,,Oh, Toru-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.84,0:13:05.85,Flashback - Top,Iori,0,0,0,,Come on in.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.85,0:13:07.47,Flashback - Italics,Miya,0,0,0,,It fits...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.85,0:13:07.47,Flashback - Top,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Sorry to barge in like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.47,0:13:08.91,Flashback - Top,Iori,0,0,0,,He's in his room.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.91,0:13:10.35,Flashback,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,I'm coming in!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.35,0:13:12.03,Flashback,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry, Miyamura.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.03,0:13:13.82,Flashback,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Could you let me look at your textbook?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.82,0:13:15.51,Flashback,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,I forgot mine at school.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.51,0:13:16.63,Flashback,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.63,0:13:17.60,Flashback,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.63,0:13:17.60,Flashback - Top,Miya,0,0,0,,Not now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.60,0:13:19.24,Flashback,Miya,0,0,0,,Please not now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.80,0:13:23.72,Flashback,Miya,0,0,0,,I-It's not what you think, Ishikawa-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.72,0:13:24.65,Flashback,Miya,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.65,0:13:27.35,Flashback,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Yeah, it looks good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.91,0:13:31.72,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,It wasn't what it looked like!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.72,0:13:33.79,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,What, so you won't wear one again?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.79,0:13:35.59,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,You should try it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.59,0:13:38.42,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Ah, but your hair could be...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.88,0:13:41.36,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,A little longer. Just a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.36,0:13:42.52,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Shoulder length.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.52,0:13:44.25,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Or just enough to hide your ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.25,0:13:46.40,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,Can you stop playing mental dress-up with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.93,0:13:47.89,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,I've got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.89,0:13:49.17,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Just grow it out for six months.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.17,0:13:50.25,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,Now you're deciding things?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.25,0:13:52.68,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,Why? What's so great about \Nsailor-style uniforms?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.68,0:13:54.74,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,You used to hate them!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.74,0:13:57.23,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,No, I didn't! I told you last time, but—
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.23,0:13:59.54,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,Like I remember!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.54,0:14:01.57,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,{\i1}I seem to run into them a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.57,0:14:02.94,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,President!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.83,0:14:02.94,Main - Top,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Sengoku!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.23,0:14:02.69,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,400)\fnComic Sans MS\shad0\bord0\b1\c&H5533C3&\frz348.9\pos(179.636,216.909)}Shudder
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.32,0:14:04.54,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,Sailor uniforms or blazers?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.54,0:14:05.59,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Which is better?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.59,0:14:06.41,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.41,0:14:08.95,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,The sailor style looks great on girls, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.95,0:14:11.31,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,That silhouette leaves me speechless.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.31,0:14:13.55,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,No, it's gotta be a blazer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.55,0:14:15.39,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,They work with neckties or ribbons.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.39,0:14:16.31,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,Right, President?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.31,0:14:19.21,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,What are you two talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.21,0:14:21.26,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,You know! How it gets a man going
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.26,0:14:23.11,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,when he sees girls in clothes he likes!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.11,0:14:24.98,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Oh, so your preferences?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.98,0:14:29.06,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,Yes! Ishikawa-kun says the sailor style \Nis better and won't listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.20,0:14:32.22,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,I actually prefer tracksuits.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.97,0:14:37.85,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs36\b1\shad0\bord0\c&H1D1C18&\pos(600.727,12.909)}S\NH\NO\NC\NK
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.23,0:14:34.98,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Whoa, is he serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.98,0:14:37.85,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,What?! Athletic wear is good, right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.47,0:14:40.70,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Sengoku, just be honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.70,0:14:42.75,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,You like the school swimsuits, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.75,0:14:44.86,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,Really, President? That's a bit much!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.86,0:14:45.98,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,That's not what I said!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.98,0:14:47.61,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Either that or gym bloomers.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.61,0:14:48.90,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,What year do you think it is?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.90,0:14:51.03,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Then what's in nowadays?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.03,0:14:53.43,Main - Top,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Now it's those... navy socks, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.62,0:14:54.71,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,{\i1}Miyamura likes blazers.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.43,0:14:55.52,Main - Top,Miya,0,0,0,,Oh, and black knee-highs are good, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.91,0:14:57.00,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(730,1)\fnImpact\an4\shad0\c&H2A2A2F&\3c&HE9F0EE&\pos(99.636,177.696)}Acquiring odd intel
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.52,0:14:57.00,Main - Top,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Yeah, I get you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.69,0:15:01.51,Flashback - Italics,Remi,0,0,0,,Oh, I don't mind Sengoku-kun doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.51,0:15:02.51,Flashback - Italics,Miya,0,0,0,,Why not?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.27,0:15:05.72,Main,Male Student B,0,0,0,,Sengoku-kun, your shirt \Nlooks a little baggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.72,0:15:08.01,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Does it? I think it's the same as always.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.92,0:15:11.51,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,{\i1}I like his slender body.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.05,0:15:13.90,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,{\i1}He's self-conscious about being too thin
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.90,0:15:16.81,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,{\i1}and puts shirts on under his white one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.23,0:15:20.27,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,{\i1}I know all about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.06,0:15:25.02,Main,_Both,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.27,0:15:25.02,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\shad0\c&H39343A&\3c&HC4C6C8&\move(276.364,160.909,345.637,160.909)}Student Counseling
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.43,0:15:26.65,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.65,0:15:28.28,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,Didn't you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.28,0:15:32.65,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,Swimming is optional, but all the boys \Nhave to do it on the last day.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.65,0:15:34.29,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,N-No one told us!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.29,0:15:36.18,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,They changed the rule this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.18,0:15:38.41,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,You got a notice about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.16,0:15:41.92,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,And you can't be absent without good reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.38,0:15:43.31,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,Like a broken leg?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.31,0:15:44.92,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Don't be rash, Miyamura-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.92,0:15:46.20,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,This isn't fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.20,0:15:47.55,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,Why only the boys?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.55,0:15:49.63,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,Right?! I couldn't agree more!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.63,0:15:51.05,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,We're on different pages!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.87,0:15:55.56,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,I'm perpetually amazed that \Nthey let you be a teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.56,0:15:57.20,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,I'm pretty smart, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.20,0:15:58.63,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,And I like high school girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.63,0:15:59.75,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,They should come and arrest you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.75,0:16:00.43,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,Hey now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.77,0:16:02.30,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,Why not just do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.30,0:16:04.44,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,It's one day in the pool.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.86,0:16:06.54,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,Can I keep my clothes on?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.54,0:16:08.57,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,I'd like to as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.57,0:16:10.24,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,Are you trying to drown?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.80,0:16:12.55,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,So you don't want to take your clothes off?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.55,0:16:14.66,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,My clothes are like skin to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.66,0:16:16.24,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,A second skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.53,0:16:19.06,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Would you have me rip off my own skin
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.06,0:16:22.48,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,and then sit out in the scorching sun?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.48,0:16:24.12,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,Calm down, Sengoku.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.12,0:16:27.67,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,Extra! "Cruel School Skins Student!"
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.67,0:16:29.63,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,Don't go making up headlines.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.63,0:16:31.79,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Four days until pool day...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.79,0:16:33.89,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,If only the world would end.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.89,0:16:36.57,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,Oh, Sensei, I have an excuse for that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.57,0:16:38.64,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,What, you're gonna skip?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.64,0:16:42.44,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,Four days from now will overlap \Nwith my 28-day cycle.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.44,0:16:44.79,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,I have no idea what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.79,0:16:46.15,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,That's no fair, Miyamura-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.15,0:16:48.45,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Sensei, I have the same excuse for that day!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.45,0:16:49.70,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,President!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.70,0:16:52.28,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,Just cut the crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.28,0:16:55.66,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fs20\fnComic Sans MS\shad0\bord0\b1\frz11.63\c&HA26247&\move(241.454,113.636,234.909,97.636)}Shutting up
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.28,0:16:55.66,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,No matter how much you whine, \Nyou're not getting out of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.66,0:16:59.40,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.40,0:17:00.71,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,That's too bad, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.71,0:17:02.41,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Wh-What's going on, Miyamura-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.15,0:17:06.54,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,Sensei, I don't own a swimsuit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.54,0:17:08.50,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,Well, not to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.50,0:17:12.30,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,The school is prepared, \Nso they'll let you rent one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.67,0:17:14.65,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,That's great news, Miyamura-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.65,0:17:15.35,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.35,0:17:18.44,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,I just don't understand\Nwhy there's no pool day for the girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.44,0:17:20.97,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Because there are guys like you \Nat the school. Get a clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.97,0:17:23.58,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,I never should've applied to Katagiri High.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.58,0:17:26.56,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,But then you never would've met Hori.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.56,0:17:28.20,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,Don't sell me short.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.20,0:17:29.86,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,I'd have found a way to meet her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.86,0:17:30.96,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,Don't mess with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.96,0:17:32.19,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,Now you wanna get expelled?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.49,0:17:35.85,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,I hope that when I wake up in four days, \Nmy right arm will have exploded.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.85,0:17:37.57,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,Can't you just fake a cold?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.91,0:17:39.83,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Okay, a cold it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.83,0:17:42.17,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,A cold that will blow up my arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.17,0:17:44.33,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,What kind of colds do you catch?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.33,0:17:46.39,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,You've got it good though, President.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.39,0:17:48.28,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,You can at least wear a swimsuit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.28,0:17:50.59,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,What burden do you bear, Miyamura?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.91,0:17:54.65,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,What? You embarrassed about \Nputting on a swimsuit, Miyamura?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.59,0:18:00.04,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,How's getting in the pool\Nin a swimsuit any better than coming
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.59,0:18:04.35,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\fs28\b1\shad0\c&HF3F5F3&\an9}Serious
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.04,0:18:01.97,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,to English class in your birthday suit?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.97,0:18:04.35,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,You're talking to your English teacher, dolt.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.84,0:18:08.27,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,I'd rather be publicly guillotined \Nthan be seen in a swimsuit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.27,0:18:11.86,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,Why is this a matter\Nof life or death for you, Sengoku?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.61,0:18:15.86,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,Well, I can tell that you guys \Nreally don't want to get in the pool.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.60,0:18:19.39,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,I'll talk to Sasaki-sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.86,0:18:20.87,Main,_Both,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.87,0:18:22.48,Main,_Both,0,0,0,,F-F-For real?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.48,0:18:24.12,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,Speak to your elders politely.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.12,0:18:25.62,Main,_Both,0,0,0,,Thanks a bunch!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.62,0:18:27.28,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,Yeah, that still coulda been better.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.28,0:18:30.70,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,Will you really talk to Sasaki-sensei?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.70,0:18:34.00,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,I will, but no promises.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.00,0:18:37.65,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,It's a teacher's duty to listen\Nto students' concerns and find solutions!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.09,0:18:34.96,Main,SFX,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,480)\fnArial\an4\1a&HFF&\bord1\shad0\3c&H888DD6&\b1\c&H888DD6&\4c&H888DD6&}Intense
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.65,0:18:39.63,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,Don't put it like that. \NYou're making me nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.09,0:18:42.03,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,Four days from now,\Nwe will {\i1}not{\i0} be undressing!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.03,0:18:43.51,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,And you're getting bolder.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.02,0:18:46.85,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,You'll both still need a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.85,0:18:49.84,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Miyamura-kun is on his period,\Nand I'll be in an explosion.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.84,0:18:50.48,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.48,0:18:52.84,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,Is that really what you want me to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.84,0:18:53.86,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,No, not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.86,0:18:55.95,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,We arrived at those through \Nextensive compromising.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.95,0:18:57.86,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,This is gonna be a pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.64,0:19:02.11,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,What a big relief, though. \NI wasn't sure what I'd do.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.91,0:19:03.73,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,I wanna hit the beach.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.73,0:19:04.74,Main,_Both,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.74,0:19:07.00,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,Woo-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.26,0:19:10.46,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Shu, no cannonballs!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.46,0:19:11.75,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,The pool is the best!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.75,0:19:13.67,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Aren't you hot, Miyamura-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.67,0:19:16.08,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,No, I am, but I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.08,0:19:17.26,Main,Male Student C,0,0,0,,You're making {\i1}me{\i0} hot, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.60,0:19:20.12,Main,Sasaki,0,0,0,,Get that deck clean, you slackers!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.12,0:19:21.51,Main,_Both,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.55,0:19:25.46,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Man, my feet are hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.46,0:19:27.15,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,Don't you have sandals, President?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.15,0:19:29.27,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Remi took them before I got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.27,0:19:31.39,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Sengoku, why not come in for a dip?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.39,0:19:33.01,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,I would if no one else was around.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.01,0:19:34.40,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,You're like one of the girls!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.02,0:19:37.25,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,Sengoku-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.25,0:19:38.78,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,You're asking for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.78,0:19:40.90,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,Bring it on! Bring it, bring it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.16,0:19:43.47,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Ow...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.47,0:19:45.40,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,We were just clowning around a little..
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.40,0:19:47.34,Main,Sasaki,0,0,0,,Quit clowning around and get to work!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.34,0:19:48.56,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.23,0:19:52.42,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Are you two shrinking violets doing your job?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.42,0:19:54.25,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Oh, Kyo-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.25,0:19:55.67,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,What's with the surprise?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.67,0:19:56.84,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,You on your way home?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.84,0:19:58.43,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,The girls only had to come for the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.43,0:19:59.17,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,See ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.17,0:20:01.39,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Hey, Remi, my sandals!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.39,0:20:02.43,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,Not a chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.83,0:20:05.36,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,I'm not giving them back!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.65,0:20:07.72,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Are those sandals cool?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.72,0:20:09.00,Main,Remi,0,0,0,,Yep, nice and cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.00,0:20:10.27,Main,Male Student D,0,0,0,,I heard girls!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.27,0:20:11.22,Main,Male Student E,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.22,0:20:12.80,Main,Male Student F,0,0,0,,Ayasaki's feet are exposed!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.80,0:20:14.90,Main,Male Student E,0,0,0,,You're right! They're so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.94,0:20:18.99,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Get back in the water, you pervy kappas!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.99,0:20:20.19,Main,Male Student E,0,0,0,,Sengoku's pissed!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.19,0:20:21.09,Main,Male Student F,0,0,0,,The president is scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.09,0:20:22.32,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,What are they doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.32,0:20:24.68,Main,Sasaki,0,0,0,,I told you to clean!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.68,0:20:25.95,Main,_Both,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.83,0:20:31.87,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,Why clean it when it's not even dirty?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.87,0:20:33.13,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,My thoughts exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.13,0:20:34.21,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.75,0:20:36.71,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,How's it going?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.71,0:20:37.58,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Our messiah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.58,0:20:38.66,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,Our messiah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.96,0:20:40.71,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(520,1)\fnImpact\fs20\shad0\c&H2A2C34&\3c&HF5F6F1&\pos(106.909,56.182)}Messiah
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.66,0:20:40.71,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,Don't call me that. You're being pains.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.34,0:20:43.63,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,Miyamura, aren't you hot in that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.63,0:20:46.10,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,Yes, of course I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.10,0:20:48.26,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,Why do you look tired of hearing that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.26,0:20:49.96,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Why did you come, Sensei?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.96,0:20:52.39,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,The girls left, so I got bored.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.39,0:20:54.06,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,Now there're only guys around.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.06,0:20:55.59,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's what I figured.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.59,0:20:57.10,Main,Terajima,0,0,0,,Yasuda-sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.10,0:20:58.07,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,It's Terajima-sensei...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.07,0:21:00.98,Main,Terajima,0,0,0,,I put you in charge of the boys' \Ntutoring session, didn't I?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.98,0:21:02.72,Main,Terajima,0,0,0,,Are you stupid or something?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.72,0:21:05.02,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,Yeah, I might be.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.02,0:21:07.53,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,{\i1}He just said he was smart four days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.53,0:21:10.54,Main,Terajima,0,0,0,,Honestly, I don't have time for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.85,0:21:10.54,Main - Top,Yasuda,0,0,0,,See ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.54,0:21:13.42,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Man, Sengoku, your legs are so thin!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.44,0:21:16.91,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,It's not like it's on purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.91,0:21:18.21,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,What's your hips measurement?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.21,0:21:18.91,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.91,0:21:21.48,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,So, what's the deal, Sengoku? Can't swim?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.48,0:21:22.40,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Don't mess with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.40,0:21:23.92,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,I'm invincible in the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.19,0:21:28.94,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,I'm perfectly at home in the water.\NIt is my domain.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.94,0:21:30.81,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Then what're you doing on land?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.81,0:21:33.13,Main,Miya,0,0,0,,I really like swimming, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.13,0:21:35.69,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,That's rich coming from a guy\Nwho's skipping pool day.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.69,0:21:38.73,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,{\i1}Well, I know Miyamura wants \Nto keep his tattoos a secret...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.73,0:21:42.15,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,Ow! A cramp! My foot cramped!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.00,0:21:43.19,Main - Top,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Shu, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.95,0:21:47.96,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,You did that {\i1}Inugami Clan{\i0} \Nhandstand thing, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.96,0:21:50.09,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,No... but I won't deny it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.09,0:21:51.13,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Which is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.50,0:21:56.47,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, why are Sengoku-san \Nand Miyamura excused today?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.47,0:21:57.71,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,They seem fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.71,0:22:01.35,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Sengoku's arm blew up, \Nand Miyamura's on his period.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.35,0:22:02.93,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.99,0:22:04.71,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.06,0:22:09.33,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Well, it's summer, so there're \Nbound to be a few explosions.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.47,0:23:39.98,Main,,0,0,0,,{\fad(487,1)\c&HC2A774&\3c&HF4F9ED&\shad0\an7\fs16\pos(452.242,317.744)}Next time\Npage.2 Cooking Class
